From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Roman Leventov <leventov.ru@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 28 Sep 2026 11:25:34 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 15/15] wasm: add native value-marshalling primitives

Expose a native UTF-8 string writer to Static Hermes extern calls and allow Hermes string values as native arguments. Add an own-enumerable entry snapshot API that preserves Object.entries getter and proxy order while avoiding JavaScript pair-array allocation. The typed value adapter uses both facilities to move values across a host boundary without a JavaScript JSON walk.
